            "repere": "Paragraphe · BUT, before you rush out to a nearby sup",
            "text": "<span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Nunito Sans&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 63, 63);\">BUT, before you rush out to a nearby supermarket or online store to get any regular magnesium supplement, here’s what you need to know…</span><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 63, 63);\">&nbsp;</span></span>",
